an><span class="goban-pt"></span><span class="goban-pt"></span><span class="goban-pt"></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-b"></span></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-w"></span></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-b"></span></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-w"></span></span><span class="goban-pt"></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-w"></span></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-w"></span></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-b"></span></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-b"></span></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-b"></span></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-b"></span></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-w"></span></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-w"></span></span><span class="goban-pt goban-r"></span></span><span class="goban-row"><span class="goban-pt goban-l"></span><span class="goban-pt"></span><span class="goban-pt"></span><span class="goban-pt"></span><span class="goban-pt"></span><span class="goban-pt"></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-b"></span></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-w"></span></span><span class="goban-pt"></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-w"></span></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-w"></span></span><span class="goban-pt"></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-w"></span></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-b"></span></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-b"></span></span><span class="goban-pt"></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-b"></span></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-w"></span></span><span class="goban-pt goban-r"></span></span><span class="goban-row"><span class="goban-pt goban-dl"></span><span class="goban-pt goban-d"></span><span class="goban-pt goban-d"></span><span class="goban-pt goban-d"></span><span class="goban-pt goban-d"></span><span class="goban-pt goban-d"></span><span class="goban-pt goban-d"></span><span class="goban-pt goban-d"></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-w"></span></span><span class="goban-pt goban-d"></span><span class="goban-pt goban-d"></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-w"></span></span><span class="goban-pt goban-d"></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-b"></span></span><span class="goban-pt goban-d"></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-b"></span></span><span class="goban-pt goban-d"></span><span class="goban-pt"><span class="goban-stone goban-b"></span></span><span class="goban-pt goban-dr"></span></span></span></div>
<p>此局“耳赤之局”为古谱名局，此局开盘秀策就中了幻庵的大斜<a href="/w/index.php?title=%E5%A5%97%E6%89%8B&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1" class="new" title="套手（页面不存在）">套手</a>而落后。但在第125手（图25）下完时，白棋见小的下了第126手，结果被秀策下到天王山第127手；因为这盘是在普通茶院进行，在场皆不是职业棋士，无人看出此棋之用，还是认为白优势；但有位不会下棋的医生悄声说“黑棋赢定了”，大家都不信问由。医生说道：“刚刚黑棋那手下完后，幻庵耳朵整个红掉了，显见被黑棋下到了要点，而懊恼不已，如此幻庵的信心消失了，则黑必胜。”果然最后黑三目胜。
连棋灵王动画第63集中，也引用此盘棋谱，说明秀策是如何下出这杰出的一手。
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="後世評價"><span id=".E5.BE.8C.E4.B8.96.E8.A9.95.E5.83.B9"></span>后世评价</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%9C%AC%E5%9B%A0%E5%9D%8A%E7%A7%80%E7%AD%96&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9" title="编辑章节：后世评价"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<figure class="mw-default-size" typeof="mw:File/Thumb"><a href="/wiki/File:Stele_of_Honinbo_Shusaku_in_Ishikiri-Kazekiri_Shrine.jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Stele_of_Honinbo_Shusaku_in_Ishikiri-Kazekiri_Shrine.jpg/250px-Stele_of_Honinbo_Shusaku_in_Ishikiri-Kazekiri_Shrine.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="250" height="333" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Stele_of_Honinbo_Shusaku_in_Ishikiri-Kazekiri_Shrine.jpg/500px-Stele_of_Honinbo_Shusaku_in_Ishikiri-Kazekiri_Shrine.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="3024" data-file-height="4032" /></a><figcaption>本因坊秀策碑</figcaption></figure>
<p>秀策的棋风，众人皆知的<a href="/wiki/%E7%A7%80%E7%AD%96%E6%B5%81" title="秀策流">秀策流</a>，不像丈和力量大杀型，也不像秀和巧妙交换，亦不需要什么妙手。秀策以坚实的慢慢取实利，把错误降到最低，进入中盘时，已毫无破绽的完胜。秀策的坚实，以现代来说过于坚实而不免有点损，但在黑无贴目负担的时代，黑棋却可以一步一步的推向胜利。曾经秀策下完一盘棋，旁人问他说谁赢，秀策说“我拿黑棋。”成为秀策的名言。后世评论“如果是没贴目的棋，黑棋要照秀策的下法，白棋则要照秀荣的下法，让子棋则非学秀哉下法不可。”。
</p><p><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E7%9F%B3%E8%B0%B7%E5%BB%A3%E7%AD%96&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1" class="new" title="石谷广策（页面不存在）">石谷广策</a><sup id="cite&#95;ref-6" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-6"><span class="cite-bracket">&#91;</span>6<span class="cite-bracket">&#93;</span></a></sup>虽为秀策师兄，却对秀策十分敬佩，甚至自称为秀策的徒弟，秀策也将“策”字相赠。秀策死后，广策散尽家产，表彰秀策事迹。<a href="/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E6%B2%BB%E7%B6%AD%E6%96%B0" class="mw-redirect" title="明治维新">明治维新</a>时，秀策地位已高过丈和，正式成为“后圣”（前圣为道策）。不过到了近代再次将丈和称为“后圣”，三人合称“三圣”。
</p><p>秀策虽未继承本因坊家督，棋力也只到上手，但后世尊其为棋圣，是以多省去迹目二字，直接称其为“本因坊秀策”。
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="紀念"><span id=".E7.B4.80.E5.BF.B5"></span>纪念</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%9C%AC%E5%9B%A0%E5%9D%8A%E7%A7%80%E7%AD%96&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10" title="编辑章节：纪念"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>2014年6月6日，<a href="/wiki/Google" title="Google">Google</a>首页的<a href="/wiki/Doodle" class="mw-redirect" title="Doodle">标志</a>，以纪念本因坊秀策185岁诞辰。但因为同日为二次世界大战著名的诺曼底登陆 （<a href="/wiki/D-Day" class="mw-redirect" title="D-Day">D-Day</a>， Operation Neptune，Operation Overlord, ) 70周年纪念日，<a href="/wiki/Google" title="Google">Google</a>备受以英国为首的欧洲参战同盟国的抨击，而要在当天稍后发表公报解释此为技术失误，继而将<a href="/wiki/Doodle" class="mw-redirect" title="Doodle">标志</a>撤换。
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="参见"><span id=".E5.8F.82.E8.A7.81"></span>参见</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%9C%AC%E5%9B%A0%E5%9D%8A%E7%A7%80%E7%AD%96&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11" title="编辑章节：参见"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
